* Readme file
/*
This sample race is for a 2-distance road race: 5K and 10K (the "Vernon Races").

The two distances share one course and finish; participants are separated by the
RACE field (5k or 10k). The 5K and 10K can start together or at staggered (wave)
gun times -- set the gun time for each distance from Misc, or use the
GunTimePromt5k / GunTimePromt10k dialogs.

Timing events (mats): GunStart, ChipStart, 5kSplit, Announcer, and Finish.
The optional 5kSplit is unused until you configure it.

Online integration:
  - Race Roster is the online system for registration and results (structured,
    and unstructured uploads).
  - SendGrid is used for email notifications (Web API).
  - Twilio is used for SMS notifications.

Key files:
  - @CalcPlaces          -- Clears and recomputes places per distance (5k, then 10k).
  - @CalcStatus          -- Refreshes STARTING / IN_PROGRESS / COMPLETE for timer monitoring.
  - @ResultsToRR / @ResultsUnsToRR -- Upload structured and unstructured results
    to Race Roster, per distance.
  - @AutoResults         -- One-click recalculate + structured results upload.
  - @awards5k / @awards10          -- Per-distance awards (print).
  - @awards2RR5k / @awards2RR10k   -- Per-distance awards uploaded to Race Roster.
  - AgeGraded5K / AgeGraded10K, ResultsPrint5K / ResultsPrint10K,
    TEAMSC5K / TEAMSC10K, @ResultsByGender -- Per-distance reports.
  - GunTimePromt5k / GunTimePromt10k -- Per-distance gun time entry dialogs.
  - LiveSMSFinish / LiveEmailFinish / LiveResults -- Live finisher notifications and display.

We recommend using the Priority to group your listing files.
You may also use different colors to differentiate the functionality of the different listing files.

All the files follow the best practice recommendation.
*/